Scoped drawbox and drawgrid video filters

The option tables, init's colour preparation ("invert", av_parse_color and the
CCIR YUV colour), config_input's iterative expression evaluation of x, y, w, h
and t over var_names (dar, hsub, vsub, in_h, ih, in_w, iw, sar, x, y, h, w, t,
fill), the draw_region and draw_region_rgb_packed loops with their double and
float blends, pixel_belongs_to_box, pixel_belongs_to_grid, filter_frame,
drawgrid_filter_frame and pix_fmts in src/video-drawbox.ts,
src/video-ops/drawbox.ts and src/video-ops/drawgrid.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_drawbox.c, libavutil/colorspace.h (RGB_TO_Y_CCIR,
RGB_TO_U_CCIR, RGB_TO_V_CCIR) and libavfilter/drawutils.c (ff_fill_rgba_map).
Colours are parsed by the shared parseColor (libavutil/parseutils.c
av_parse_color) and expressions by the shared expression API
(libavutil/eval.c); neither is ported again here.
